      en: ["The park was officially opened in 2018 by President Yoweri Museveni.", "The facility spans an area of approximately 600 hectares of land.", "The total investment value for the project exceeded 600 million USD.", "More than 10 different factories are currently operational within the park.", "The facility provides employment for over 3,000 local Ugandan workers.", "A large ceramic factory produces thousands of square meters of tiles daily."],
