      en: ["The MV Kalangala and private ferry services link Bukakata with the islands.", "The port is situated approximately 40 kilometers east of Masaka City.", "Large volumes of crude palm oil are transshipped here for further processing.", "Bukakata serves as a vital gateway for tourists visiting the Ssese Islands.", "Dredging of the lakeside has been conducted to accommodate larger vessels.", "The port plays a key role in ensuring supply security for island inhabitants."],
